Written with the help of an AI assistant (Claude). Not affiliated with any of the projects below.

This work builds on, modifies or redistributes parts of:

- FX Steam Launcher (steamac), Copyright 2026 FX GAMES FZ LLC, Apache-2.0 — https://github.com/fxgl/steamac
  and StonkGuy's fork with Easy Anti-Cheat support, v1.9-eac.1 — https://github.com/StonkGuy/steamac
  * patches/launcher-right-drag-mouselook.patch modifies host/launcher/Sources/steamac-vm/Window.swift.
  * The release asset steamac-vm-1.9-eac.1-fellowship is that launcher binary built from tag v1.9-eac.1 with the
    patch above (Apache-2.0).
  * mac/install-launcher-fixes.sh changes one instruction of the launcher's libwmtr_host.dylib (wmtr, Apache-2.0)
