  * mac/steamac-vm.entitlements is copied from host/launcher/steamac-vm.entitlements.
  * vm/install-fex.sh follows fex-eac/install-fex-tool.sh and fex-eac/build-fex.sh.
- libkrun, Apache-2.0 — https://github.com/containers/libkrun
  * mac/libkrun-include/ are libkrun's public headers as patched by steamac (needed to build the launcher).
- FEX-Emu, MIT, Copyright (c) 2019 Ryan Houdek — https://github.com/FEX-Emu/FEX
